<div id="revert-modal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-[100] flex items-center justify-center bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm transition-opacity">
  <div class="w-full max-w-md rounded-2xl border border-amber-900 bg-[#051a33] p-6 shadow-2xl">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-amber-400 mb-2">Revert Edit</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 mb-6">Are you sure you want to revert your edits to "<span id="revert-modal-title" class="text-white font-medium"></span>"?<br/><br/>This will create a new pull request on GitHub to undo your original changes.</p>
    <div class="flex justify-end gap-3">
      <button onclick="window.closeRevertModal()" class="rounded-xl px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 hover:bg-[#0f2c56] transition-colors">Cancel</button>
      <button id="confirm-revert-btn" class="rounded-xl bg-amber-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-amber-500 transition-colors">Yes, Revert Edit</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
